# Visual Studio / .NET
.vs/
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/TestResults/
**/coverage/
**/coverage.*
**/artifacts/
**/publish/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# JetBrains / VS Code
.idea/
.vscode/
*.DotSettings.user

# Node.js / Next.js
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/out/
**/.turbo/
**/.vercel/
**/.npm/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Environment files and local secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/*.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/*.env.example
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/appsettings.*.Local.json

# Local agent metadata and generated setup artifacts
.local/
.codex/
.claude/
**/AGENTS.md
**/CLAUDE.md

# Local certificates and keys
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
*.p12

# Local databases, logs, and temporary files
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.log
backups/
*.dump
tmp/
temp/
output/
.ssh/
id_rsa
id_ed25519
*.bak
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.zip
*.7z
/realms/

# Operating system files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Docker local overrides
docker-compose.override.yml
compose.override.yml

# Documentation: publish README files only.
*.md
!README.md
!**/README.md

# Infrastructure: keep only reusable, secret-free local identity templates.
/deploy/*
!/deploy/keycloak/
/deploy/keycloak/*
!/deploy/keycloak/.env.example
!/deploy/keycloak/development-realm.json
!/deploy/keycloak/google-provider.template.json
!/deploy/keycloak/server-realm.template.json
!/deploy/keycloak/smtp.template.json
!/deploy/keycloak/README.md
!/deploy/keycloak/themes/
!/deploy/keycloak/themes/**
!/deploy/keycloak/production.env.example
!/deploy/keycloak/staging.env.example

# Scripts: explicitly allow the reusable CI/development entry points.
/scripts/*
!/scripts/configure-identity.mjs
!/scripts/deploy-production.sh
!/scripts/deploy-environment.sh
!/scripts/oracle-server.py
!/scripts/deploy-staging.sh
!/scripts/rollback-production.sh
!/scripts/operations.py


# Public, blank Oracle runtime templates.
!/.env.production.example
!/.env.staging.example
